flowchart TD
    Start([User visits application]) --> Page[Account Login page]
    Page --> Submit[Enter username and password]
    Submit --> Valid{Model valid?}
    Valid -->|No| Error1[Show validation errors]
    Error1 --> Page

    Valid -->|Yes| CheckUser[Validate user in database]
    CheckUser --> Found{User exists?}
    Found -->|No| Error2[Invalid email or password]
    Error2 --> Page

    Found -->|Yes| SignIn[Password sign-in]
    SignIn --> Success{Login succeeded?}
    Success -->|No| Error3[Account locked or not allowed]
    Error3 --> Page

    Success -->|Yes| GetRole[Get user roles]
    GetRole --> RoleCheck{Role?}

    RoleCheck -->|Doctor only| PatientIndex[Redirect Patient Index]
    RoleCheck -->|Staff only| PatientIndex
    RoleCheck -->|SuperAdmin or Admin| HomeIndex[Redirect Dashboard]

    PatientIndex --> End([Authenticated session started])
    HomeIndex --> End
